{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_node_page", "label": "Node.js (voll unterst\u00fctzt ab 24)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/runtime/node.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_node_node24_floor", "label": "Warum Node 24 als Untergrenze", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/runtime/node.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u00c4lteste aktive LTS-Linie (20 ist EOL, 22 im Maintenance) und die erste, auf der crypto.subtle f\u00fcr AES-GCM, fetch, ein nativer WebSocket-Client, natives zstd in node:zlib sowie AsyncLocalStorage und node:test alle an Bord sind."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_node_better_sqlite3", "label": "better-sqlite3 (natives Modul)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/runtime/node.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Erst-Install verlangt Build-Tools (gyp, Python, C++-Compiler); Alpine-Images brauchen python3/make/g++ oder vorgefertigte Binaries."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_node_peer_dependencies", "label": "Node-Peer-Dependencies pro Subsystem", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/runtime/node.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Die Lazy-Imports des Frameworks hei\u00dfen, fehlende Peer-Deps brechen ungenutzte Features nicht \u2014 wer nie einen KafkaActor instanziiert, kann kafkajs weglassen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_runtime_node_esm_only", "label": "ESM-only-Auslieferung", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/runtime/node.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "c